flowchart TD
    A[Gate Operator Login<br/>/login?role=operator] --> B{Auth Check}
    B -->|Valid| C[Gate Console: /gate/:gateId]
    B -->|Invalid| A

    C --> D[Load Gate Context<br/>GET /api/gates/:gateId/info]
    D --> E[Display Gate Name, Shift Info]
    E --> F{Operator Console Tabs}

    %% Live Scanner Desk Flow
    F -->|Click Scanner Tab DEFAULT| G1[Live Scan Desk<br/>/gate/:gateId/scan]
    G1 --> H1[Direction Toggle<br/>IN / OUT Button Group]
    H1 --> I1[Set Active Direction]
    I1 --> J1{Scan Input Method}
    
    J1 -->|Camera Scan| K1[Activate Camera<br/>QR Scanner Modal]
    K1 --> L1[User Presents QR Code]
    L1 --> M1[Decode QR -> Extract Person/Pass ID]
    
    J1 -->|Barcode Scanner| K2[Hardware Scanner Input<br/>Handheld/Desktop Scanner]
    K2 --> M1
    
    J1 -->|Manual Entry| K3[Text Input Field]
    K3 --> L2[Type Roll No / Employee ID / Visitor Pass]
    L2 --> M2[Click Submit / Press Enter]
    M2 --> M1

    %% Verification & Processing Flow
    M1 --> N1[POST /api/gates/:gateId/scan<br/>Body: personId, direction]
    N1 --> O1{Backend Validation}
    
    O1 -->|Person Not Found| P1[Error Modal: Invalid ID]
    P1 --> Q1[Play Error Beep<br/>Red Flash Screen]
    Q1 --> G1
    
    O1 -->|Found - Student Day Scholar| P2[Check Schedule<br/>GET /api/persons/:id/verify]
    P2 --> Q2{Validation Result}
    Q2 -->|Authorized| R1[Success Screen<br/>Green Check, Photo, Name]
    R1 --> S1[Play Success Chime]
    S1 --> T1[Trigger Turnstile Pulse<br/>POST /api/gates/:gateId/unlock]
    T1 --> U1[Log Entry/Exit<br/>POST /api/activity/log]
    U1 --> V1[Update Live Feed]
    V1 --> G1
    
    Q2 -->|Denied| R2[Denial Screen<br/>Red X, Reason Display]
    R2 --> S2[Play Deny Beep]
    S2 --> G1
    
    O1 -->|Found - Student Hosteler OUT| P3{Check Active Pass}
    P3 -->|Valid Pass Found| Q3[Verify Pass Window<br/>Start Time, End Time, Approvals]
    Q3 --> R3[Success Flow -> R1]
    P3 -->|No Pass / Expired| Q4[Block Screen<br/>No Valid Pass Message]
    Q4 --> R4[Alert Supervisor Button]
    R4 --> S3[POST /api/alerts/create<br/>Type: UNAUTHORIZED_EXIT]
    S3 --> T2[Supervisor Notified]
    T2 --> G1
    
    O1 -->|Found - Student Hosteler IN| P4{Check Curfew}
    P4 -->|On Time| Q5[Normal Entry Flow -> R1]
    P4 -->|Late / Post-Curfew| Q6[Late Entry Warning Screen]
    Q6 --> R5[Log with Late Flag<br/>POST /api/activity/log-late]
    R5 --> S4[Auto-Alert Warden & Parent<br/>POST /api/alerts/curfew-breach]
    S4 --> T3[Allow Entry -> Turnstile Unlock]
    T3 --> G1
    
    O1 -->|Found - Faculty/Staff/Worker| P5[Check Employment Status & Shift]
    P5 --> Q7[Auto Toggle IN/OUT<br/>Log Attendance]
    Q7 --> R1
    
    O1 -->|Found - Visitor| P6{Check Visitor Pass}
    P6 -->|Valid Active Pass| Q8[Verify Host Approval Status]
    Q8 --> R6[Log Visitor Entry/Exit]
    R6 --> R1
    P6 -->|No Pass| Q9[Redirect Screen<br/>Visit Registration Kiosk]
    Q9 --> G1

    %% Recent Scans Tab Flow
    F -->|Click Recent Scans Tab| G2[Scan History Stream<br/>/gate/:gateId/history]
    G2 --> H2[Load Recent Scans<br/>GET /api/gates/:gateId/activity]
    H2 --> I2[Timeline Feed<br/>Last 50 Scans]
    I2 --> J2[Each Scan Card Shows<br/>Photo, Name, Time, Direction, Status]
    J2 --> K4[Auto-refresh Every 5s<br/>WebSocket or Polling]
    K4 --> I2
    
    I2 --> L3[Click Scan Card]
    L3 --> M3[Scan Detail Modal]
    M3 --> N2[Full Person Info<br/>Roll/Emp No, Role, Status]

    %% Approvals Desk Flow
    F -->|Click Approvals Tab| G3[Pending Approvals<br/>/gate/:gateId/approvals]
    G3 --> H3[Load Pending Items<br/>GET /api/operator/approvals]
    H3 --> I3[Approval Cards<br/>Disputed Passes, Visitor Approvals]
    I3 --> J3[Click Approval Card]
    J3 --> K5[Approval Detail Modal]
    K5 --> L4{Decision Buttons}
    L4 -->|Approve| M4[Confirm Approval]
    M4 --> N3[POST /api/approvals/:id/approve]
    N3 --> O2[Success Toast]
    O2 --> H3
    
    L4 -->|Reject| M5[Rejection Reason Modal]
    M5 --> N4[POST /api/approvals/:id/reject]
    N4 --> H3
    
    L4 -->|Escalate to Supervisor| M6[POST /api/approvals/:id/escalate]
    M6 --> N5[Supervisor Notified]
    N5 --> H3

    %% Visitor Registration Flow
    F -->|Click Visitor Registration| G4[Visitor Kiosk<br/>/gate/:gateId/visitor-registration]
    G4 --> H4[Visitor Form]
    H4 --> I4[Fill Details<br/>Name, Phone, Purpose, Host Name]
    I4 --> J4[Capture Gov ID Photo<br/>Camera / Upload]
    J4 --> K6[Click Submit]
    K6 --> L5[POST /api/visitors/register]
    L5 --> M7[Send Host Approval Request<br/>Push Notification / SMS]
    M7 --> N6[Wait for Host Response]
    N6 --> O3{Host Action}
    O3 -->|Approved| P7[Generate Visitor QR Pass]
    P7 --> Q10[Print/Display Pass<br/>GET /api/visitors/:id/pass]
    Q10 --> R7[Issue Badge -> Allow Entry]
    R7 --> G1
    O3 -->|Rejected| P8[Denial Screen]
    P8 --> Q11[Notify Visitor]
    Q11 --> G4

    %% Shift Stats Flow
    F -->|Click Shift Stats Tab| G5[Shift Metrics<br/>/gate/:gateId/stats]
    G5 --> H5[Load Shift Data<br/>GET /api/gates/:gateId/shift-stats]
    H5 --> I5[Stats Dashboard]
    I5 --> J5[Display KPIs<br/>Total IN: X, Total OUT: Y]
    J5 --> K7[Peak Hours Chart<br/>Bar Graph]
    K7 --> L6[Alerts Count<br/>Denied: A, Late: B]
    L6 --> M8[Shift Duration Timer]
    M8 --> N7[Export Shift Report Button]
    N7 --> O4[Click Export]
    O4 --> P9[GET /api/gates/:gateId/shift-report]
    P9 --> Q12[Download PDF]

    %% Logout & Shift End Flow
    C --> X[Menu: End Shift / Logout]
    X --> Y{Confirm End Shift}
    Y -->|Yes| Z1[POST /api/gates/:gateId/shift-end]
    Z1 --> Z2[Generate Shift Summary]
    Z2 --> Z3[POST /api/auth/logout]
    Z3 --> Z4[Clear Session]
    Z4 --> A
    Y -->|Cancel| C
